## The workspace commands of myx.distro-source, declared once: a command a line, its name (its emoji is part of it), how
## it runs (`output`: unattended, what it writes followed; `terminal`: with the whole terminal), and the command,
## a TAB between them; `$MMDAPP` in a command is the root of the workspace it runs in. Two products are made of
## it, neither from the other: the tasks of the editor's palette (SourceTools.Make.VSCodeTasksFragment.include, by
## myx.distro-source's SourceTools.Make.VSCodeTasksFromWorkspaceCommands.include) and the console's commands of a
## workspace (DistroAgentsTools.fn.sh --manager-place-command-list and --manager-place-command-run).

🖥️ Start Source Console	terminal	bash '$MMDAPP/DistroSourceConsole.sh'
⬇️ Pull/Sync All Known Sources	output	bash -c 'echo "Distro DistroImageSync --all-tasks --execute-source-prepare-pull" | $MMDAPP/DistroSourceConsole.sh --non-interactive'
📥 Re-Build Source Index Snapshot (cached from source)	output	bash -c 'echo "BuildCachedFromSource.fn.sh" | $MMDAPP/DistroSourceConsole.sh --non-interactive'
🛫 Ingest Source Changes	output	bash -c 'echo "Distro DistroSourcePrepare --ingest-distro-index-from-source" | $MMDAPP/DistroSourceConsole.sh --non-interactive'
🛠️ Update Local Tools	output	bash '${MMDAPP}/.local/myx/myx.distro-.local/sh-scripts/DistroLocalTools.fn.sh' --upgrade-installed-tools
